# The ECOTI HUD plane: 100 cm ahead (+X), 200 x 200 cm (y, z in -100..100), facing back at the eye (-X).
# Top-left (y -100, z +100) is texture (0, 0). OBJ's v runs up: v = 1 at the top (importers flip it).
v 100 -100 100
v 100 100 100
v 100 100 -100
v 100 -100 -100
vt 0 1
vt 1 1
vt 1 0
vt 0 0
vn -1 0 0
f 1/1/1 2/2/1 3/3/1
f 1/1/1 3/3/1 4/4/1
